codex
The expected `0x12` is supported: IRQ 1 remains set until the later keyboard drain, and [E] synchronously adds IRQ 4. This makes the row a useful pending-state control; it does not directly count LCA stub entries. I also found a possible counting mismatch in the claimed 16-cell table and am checking the cell mapping before recommending a rerun scope.
